MENU-SCRIPT

❕This tutorial creates a static text file at "◁CacheFolder▷\grocery.txt", and does not matter which target is selected. The selected target is never modified.❕
❕If the file output of 'TextHost' was changed to a location such as "◁UsrTar▷\desktop\grocery.txt", that would create grocery.txt on the desktop of the selected target.❕

